From af006a202dd2233b626e3212b617379b8b01ee2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 06:02:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lane-298: MTP eh_proj as one 2D matmul

concat(e_norm, h_norm) is [5120, hc, n_tokens]; at n_tokens > 1 the mm ran as a batched mat-vec that re-read the 14 MB Q8_0 eh_proj per token (VK perf logger: 1.0 ms at 4 tokens, 95.6 ms at a 512-token prefill ubatch). Reshape to [5120, hc*n_tokens] for the mm and back: same math, one weight read. Draft steps (n_tokens 1) keep the same shape.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Lane: lane-298
(cherry picked from commit 220810f67dc9484bf8f8a38525d3a4509345803c)

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - fork-authored (lane-298); no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED on its own - supporting commit; see release ledger Table 2 (lane 298), the number sits on that win's main commit
---
 src/models/qwen4exp.cpp | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/models/qwen4exp.cpp b/src/models/qwen4exp.cpp
index f098e78132..c5a0310f52 100644
--- a/src/models/qwen4exp.cpp
+++ b/src/models/qwen4exp.cpp
@@ -1432,7 +1432,10 @@ llama_model_qwen4exp::graph_mtp::graph_mtp(const llama_model & model, const llm_
     h_norm = ggml_reshape_3d(ctx0, h_norm, n_embd, hc, n_tokens);
     cb(h_norm, "mtp_hnorm", il);
 
-    ggml_tensor * res_hc = build_lora_mm(layer.nextn.eh_proj, ggml_concat(ctx0, e_norm, h_norm, 0));
+    // 2D so n_tokens > 1 runs one matmul, not a batched mat-vec that re-reads eh_proj per token
+    ggml_tensor * eh_in  = ggml_concat(ctx0, e_norm, h_norm, 0);
+    ggml_tensor * res_hc = build_lora_mm(layer.nextn.eh_proj, ggml_reshape_2d(ctx0, eh_in, 2 * n_embd, hc * n_tokens));
+    res_hc = ggml_reshape_3d(ctx0, res_hc, n_embd, hc, n_tokens);
     cb(res_hc, "mtp_eh_proj", il);
 
     ggml_tensor * inject = nullptr;
